{Limit}(\\alpha)\\to\\bigcup_{\\beta&lt;\\alpha}\\beta=\\alpha\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}union\\text{-}ordinal}\\vdash \\mathrm{Limit}(\\alpha)\\to\\bigcup_{\\beta&lt;\\alpha}\\beta=\\alpha\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>极限序数等于其所有真前驱序数的并。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha=\\gamma+1\">\\(\\alpha=\\gamma+1\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigcup_{\\beta&lt;\\alpha}\\beta=\\gamma\">\\(\\bigcup_{\\beta&lt;\\alpha}\\beta=\\gamma\\)</span>，而不是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-union","status":"resolved","id":"5a295a90caf70085","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-union]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-limit-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"30f7fa6c101bbb39","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-limit-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-limit-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"30f7fa6c101bbb39","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Limit}(\\alpha)$（极限序数谓词，见 [[../batch18/58-df-limit-ordinal.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Limit}(\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}union\\text{-}ordinal}\\vdash \\mathrm{Limit}(\\